                                <h2 class="navigation__megamenu-heading">
                                    Biofuels
                                    <span class="navigation__megamenu-heading-arrow"></span>
                                </h2>
                                <p class="navigation__item-description">
                                    Lantm&#xE4;nnen Biorefineries operates northern Europe&#x27;s largest biorefinery.
                                    <span class="callout-inlinelink" href="/biofuels/">
                                        Read more
                                    </span>
                                </p>
                            </a>
                                <section class="section section-columns-4">
                                    <div class="section-container">

                                                    <div class="section-column section-column-1">
                                                        <a href="/biofuels/products/"  class="subitem__link">
                                                            <div class="navigation__item-img-container">
                                                                <img class="navigation__item-img" src="/siteassets/2.-biofuels/teaser-biofuels.jpg?width=370&amp;rmode=Crop&amp;height=180" alt="Products" />

                                                            </div>
                                                            <h3 class="navigation__item-heading">
                                                                Products
                                                            </h3>
                                                            <small class="navigation__itemdescription">
                                                                <p>Lantmannen Biorefineries produces ethanol. Some of it is used as fuel, while others are used for other technical applications such as windshield washer fluid.</p>
                                                            </small>
                                                        </a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="section-column section-column-2">
                                                        <a href="/biofuels/about-biofuels/"  class="subitem__link">
                                                            <div class="navigation__item-img-container">
                                                                <img class="navigation__item-img" src="/siteassets/2.-biofuels/produkter/agro-cleanpower-e85/agroetanol-tankstation-600x400.jpg?width=370&amp;rmode=Crop&amp;height=180" alt="About Biofuels" />

                                                            </div>
                                                            <h3 class="navigation__item-heading">
                                                                About Biofuels
                                                            </h3>
                                                            <small class="navigation__itemdescription">
                                                                <p>Our ethanol has perhaps the best climate performance in the world. In our plant, we can produce both grain-based ethanol and ethanol from second generation raw materials, so-called advanced biofuel.&nbsp;</p>
                                                            </small>
                                                        </a>
                                                    </div>
