                                <p class="navigation__item-description">
                                    Lantm&#xE4;nnen Biorefineries is part of Lantm&#xE4;nnen&#x27;s energy division and consists of the production facilities in Lidk&#xF6;ping, Norrk&#xF6;ping and Kimstad.&#xA0;
