                                <div class="title-container  ">
                                    <h1 class="article-title" >
                                        PromOat Oat Beta-Glucan Applications
                                    </h1>
                                </div>

                                <div class="content-preamble">
                                    

<p>PromOat oat beta-glucan offers a diverse range of applications in food-related products. Read more about the applications and PromOat's functional benefits below.</p>
                                </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                <div class="main-aftercontent">
                    
<div><div>
<!-- List / -->
<div id="5640785" class="list list--pingpong  ">





    <div id="list-data" class="list-wrapper list-onecolumn js-ajax-list-replace" data-cols="sm:1,md:1,lg:1,xl:1,xxl:1">



<div class="list-inner-wrapper--static-area"><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640786" class="callout callout-standard">
        <div class="callout-wrap">
                <a class="callout-link" href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/" >

                <picture class="callout-picture">
                    <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                    <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-bread-1.png?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                    <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                    <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-bread-1.png?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Bakery &#x2013; Bread, cookies and biscuits</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">O</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">at beta-glucan offers unique positioning benefits and attractive labelling options in cookies, crackers, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">muffins,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> and bread. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> is a unique soluble fibre that is neutral in colour, and</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">ideal as a functional ingredient</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">Its</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> strong water binding properties improve </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">moister and freshness even </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">after</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> freezing and thawing</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">gives a clean taste without grittiness and </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">gives access</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> to fibre</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> and </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">health</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> claims.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW162449018 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
                    <span href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/"  class="callout-inlinelink">Contact us for application information</span>
            </div>

            </a>
        </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640771" class="callout callout-standard">
        <div class="callout-wrap">
                <a class="callout-link" href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/" >

                <picture class="callout-picture">
                    <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                    <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/applications/milk-teaser-promoat.png?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                    <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                    <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/applications/milk-teaser-promoat.png?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Plant-based beverages and yoghurt</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">In plant-based dairy </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">alternatives</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> Oat beta-glucan can be used</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> alone or </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">as a complement to</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> other hydrocolloids</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> to create a thick texture and deliver a silky creaminess with no grittiness</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">.</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">Using </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> in your dairy alternatives </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">supports fo</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">am and emulsion stability and</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> contributes to a potential fibre</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> and</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">health</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> claim</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">s</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW19687798 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
