                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> Oat beta-glucan</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">is a soluble oat fibre that can be used in meat analogue. Especially in combination </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">with other hydrocolloids</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">,</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> enhances </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">your products th</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">rough </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">stabilis</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">ing</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> emulsions, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">bind</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">ing </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">water</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> and oil</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">binding the </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">system,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> and </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">maintaining</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> a stable shape at refrigerated temperatures.</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">Additionally, incorporating </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> in </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">meat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> analogues </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">can support</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> a potential fibre claim.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW218732013 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
                    <span href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/"  class="callout-inlinelink">Contact us for application information</span>
            </div>

            </a>
