                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> Oat beta-glucan is ideal to use in dietary supplements, for heart health,&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">weight management and as a texturizer to replace other </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">gums</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">.</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> has good solubility</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> adds thickness and a creamy mouthfeel, as well as a clean taste with no</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> gritti</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">ness. Using </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> in your nutrition or health supplements also contributes to potential health and nutrition claims.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW85615295 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
