<p><span class="TextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">Using </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> Oat beta-glucan</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> in pasta can contribute to health or nutrition claims. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">At the same time, there is no </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">effect on cooking time, production process</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">yield,</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">or</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> the machinability of semolina flour. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">Minimal formulation changes are needed for </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">high </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">inclusion rates</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">.</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">It is even possible</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> to replace egg with </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> in pasta.</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">&nbsp;</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW35332318 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
