                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Cream cheese</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">O</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">at beta-glucan can be used as a thickener and emulsion stabili</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">s</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">er in cream cheese. It can also be used to produce cream cheese with lower fat content without compromising the </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">spreadability</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">, creaminess or </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">flavour</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> of the </span><span class="NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">end product</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW176465470 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
