                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Ice cream</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">O</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">at beta-glucan is soluble beta</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">-</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">glucan that can be included in the formulation of ice creams providing with a smooth texture. It can also be used to replace emulsifiers in ice </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">cream, providing with better eating characteristics than other emulsifying substitutes. Including </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> in the ice cream formulation also improves the heat shock resistance and melting characteristics. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"> can be used in low fat ice creams to create a creamier and more cohesive product with a longer texture.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW30526975 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}">&nbsp;</span></p></div>
