<div id="5640784" class="callout callout-standard">
        <div class="callout-wrap">
                <a class="callout-link" href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/" target=_blank>


            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Mayonnaise</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;8769ab48-235a-4681-8d0c-d09a690cdc78|85&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469775450,&quot;cf01&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;cf01&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,469777842,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,469777843,&quot;Calibri&quot;,469777844,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,469769226,&quot;Segoe UI,Calibri&quot;,335551500,&quot;5658455&quot;,268442635,&quot;18&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">O</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">at beta-glucan can be used as a in soups, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">sauces,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01"> and dressings as a texturizer, providing with thickness, creaminess</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01"> a good </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">mouthfeel,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01"> and</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01"> a clean </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">taste</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01"> without grittiness</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">.</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">PromOa</span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">t</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0"> can be used as a substitute for other thickeners and stabili</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">s</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">ers or in combination with them. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">With the help of</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">it is possible to access fibre and health claims</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">in your soups, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">sauces,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0"> or dressings</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">. T</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">o the right you </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">can see </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">a video</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">of</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0">PromOat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0"> stabilising emulsion and replacing fat,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="pf0"> providing with </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01">a low-fat</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW8175623 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="cf01"> mayonnaise.</span></span></p></div>
                    <span href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/" target=_blank class="callout-inlinelink">Contact us for application information</span>
