            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Cosmetic products</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><span class="TextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW143750755 BCX0">PromOat</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0">O</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0">at beta-glucan can be added to cosmetic products </span><span class="NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW143750755 BCX0">in order to</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0"> thicken them and stabilise emulsions. It is a soluble beta-glucan that provides a smooth texture</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0"> without graininess</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0">. It can be used in combination with </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW143750755 BCX0">Avenacare</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW143750755 BCX0"> - Beta-glucan of smaller molecular weight, for soothing and moisturizing the skin, reducing appearance of redness, in sun protection products, or reducing the visible signs of aging.</span></span></p></div>
                    <span href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/" target=_blank class="callout-inlinelink">Contact us for application information</span>
            </div>

            </a>
        </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
